# why: Hermes tests launched from inside a dispatched kanban worker could write fixture tasks into the LIVE board and dispatch real cards with a fake pid; a hermes_cli module purge escaped the connect-level write guard and two fixtures moved HERMES_HOME but not HERMES_KANBAN_HOME. Adds a sqlite3-level guard (holds across a purge) and pins HERMES_KANBAN_HOME in both fixtures. Test-only.
# tests: tests/hermes_cli/test_kanban_sqlite_guard.py tests/hermes_cli/test_kanban_per_profile_cap.py tests/hermes_cli/test_kanban_cli_dispatch_passthrough.py
# upstream: candidate
